OL,3,GNEWSA'Illustrating Brideshead Revisited
OL,4,Awas a privilege'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he had read the book
OL,7,F"countless" times both in English and
OL,8,FChinese but had also tried to draw
OL,9,F"from the author's perspective".
